  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who value and promote global unity, cultural diversity, and inclusive social values. The meme appeals to communities engaged in social justice, education, or global citizenship movements, as it uses a positive visual metaphor to celebrate individual uniqueness and collective harmony. The target audience likely includes educators, activists, and general audiences familiar with concepts of multiculturalism and inclusivity, particularly those who resonate with messages of appreciation for all cultures and identities.",
